<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Weekly Summary: Opportunities Requiring Updates in Sales CRM</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">   
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <table style="background-color: #0071c5; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td style="padding-left: 50px; border: none;">
                    <div style="color: white;">
                        <h3 >Weekly Summary: Opportunities Requiring Updates in Sales CRM</h3>
                    </div>
                </td>
              <td style="border: none; padding-right: 20px; width: 100px;" align="right">
				<img src="[LOGO_URL]" 
					 width="50" 
					 height="40" 
					 style="width: 50px !important; height: 40px !important; min-width: 80px !important; min-height: 40px !important; max-width: 80px !important; max-height: 40px !important;" 
					 alt="Intel Logo" />
			  </td>

            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <!-- Email Body -->
    <div style="padding: 30px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6;">
        
        <p>Hello [NAME] ,</p>
        
        <p>Our records show that several of your opportunities have exceeded the SLA for their current pipeline stage and require updates in Sales CRM.</p>
        
        <p>To help you stay current and maintain pipeline accuracy, we've compiled a list of opportunities that may need attention below. Please review each one and update the required fields to ensure they can progress through the pipeline.</p>
        
      Opportunities Requiring Action: <br/>
          [REQUIRED_FIELDS]
         <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            You can view all opportunities currently breaching SLAs in the following report: 
            <a href="[REPORT_LINK]" >Opportunity Report</a>
        </p>
        
        <p>This weekly summary is intended as a gentle reminder to help maintain data quality and pipeline visibility.</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 40px;">
            Sales Excellence Team
        </p>
        
    </div>
</body>
</html>